@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam actorBorderColor #333333
skinparam participantBorderColor #333333
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #fafafa
skinparam participantFontName SimSun
skinparam participantFontSize 11
skinparam arrowColor #333333
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName SimSun
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 9

== 准备阶段 ==

actor "静态分析模块" as SA
participant "插桩模块" as IM
participant "目标程序" as TP
participant "运行时库" as RT
participant "选择模块" as SM
database "种子队列" as SQ

SA -> IM : 数组信息表
IM -> TP : 插桩后IR

== 执行阶段 ==

SQ -> TP : 选取种子执行
TP -> RT : 运行时状态数据

== 反馈阶段 ==

RT -> SM : 多样性评分
SM -> SQ : 调度决策
SQ -> TP : 下一轮种子

note right of SQ : ⟳ 闭环反馈
@enduml
